{"id":"75cf9a7e361cb7d2","group":"90","path":"90/90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise.md","title":"fact-representation-implies-numeralwise — Representation Implies Numeralwise Expressible","display":"fact-representation-implies-numeralwise — Representation Implies Numeralwise Expressible","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise","aliases":["90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise"],"display":"fact-representation-implies-numeralwise — Representation Implies Numeralwise Expressible","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-numeralwise-express]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-representation-implies-numeralwise — Representation Implies Numeralwise Expressible"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"af98bb2babeee14b\" href=\"?note=af98bb2babeee14b\" title=\"90-df-numeralwise-express\">90-df-numeralwise-express</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory in arithmetical signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span> (external relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (representing formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T\\)</span> (numeralwise-expression predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"af98bb2babeee14b\" href=\"?note=af98bb2babeee14b\" title=\"90-df-numeralwise-express\">90-df-numeralwise-express</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}_T\\)</span> (strong representability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}representation\\text{-}implies\\text{-}numeralwise}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(R,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T(R,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}representation\\text{-}implies\\text{-}numeralwise}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(R,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T(R,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在本知识库的两个上游定义中，两者都要求正、负标准数码实例分别可证，因而实际是等价而非仅单向蕴含。</li>\n<li>若另采用只要求正实例的“弱表示”约定，这个等价需要相应削弱。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeralwise-express","status":"resolved","id":"af98bb2babeee14b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeralwise-express]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeralwise-express","status":"resolved","id":"af98bb2babeee14b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T$ (numeralwise-expression predicate, see [[90-df-numeralwise-express]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Represents}_T$ (strong representability predicate, see [[90-df-representation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\vec v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Represents}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}representation\\text{-}implies\\text{-}numeralwise}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(R,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T(R,\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1343,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive.md]]\n[[90-fact-godel-number-effective.md]]\n[[90-fact-normal-system-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-fact-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[90-fact-paradox-equivalence.md]]\n[[90-fact-proof-predicate-pr.md]]\n[[90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise.md]]"}],"outgoing":["00ee901093c12d44","635265d0fe56f718","af98bb2babeee14b"]}